    carla: ldap, email_verified true, totp false, passkeys 0, disabled false

== what the stand-ins and the server saw
server: 47 requests answered, 1 message submitted, 3 accounts in its data file
directory stand-in: 3 binds accepted, 1 refused, 2 searches answered
mail stand-in: 1 connection, 1 login, 0 refused, 1 message delivered
